{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function materialize<TContext>(query): MaterializeWrapper<GetInlineResult<TContext>, TContext extends SingleResult ? true : false>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/builder/functions.ts#L867","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/query/builder/functions.ts:867"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Materialize an includes subquery into a plain value on the parent row."}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For multi-row subqueries, the parent receives an "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Array<T>"},{"type":"text","value":" snapshot\n(equivalent to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"toArray()"},{"type":"text","value":")."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"findOne()"},{"type":"text","value":" subqueries, the parent receives a single "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T | undefined"},{"type":"text","value":"\nvalue — "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":" when no child matches."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The snapshot updates reactively: parent rows re-emit when the underlying\nchildren change."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tcontext","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TContext"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TContext"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/Context.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Context"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"query","children":[{"type":"text","value":"query"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/QueryBuilder.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryBuilder"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TContext"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MaterializeWrapper"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"GetInlineResult"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TContext"},{"type":"text","value":">, "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TContext"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/SingleResult.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SingleResult"}]},{"type":"text","value":" ? "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":" : "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// Multi-row: produces Array<Issue> on each project\nselect(({ p }) => ({\n  ...p,\n  issues: materialize(\n    q.from({ i: issues }).where(({ i }) => eq(i.projectId, p.id)),\n  ),\n}))\n\n// Singleton: produces Author | undefined on each post\nselect(({ p }) => ({\n  ...p,\n  author: materialize(\n    q.from({ a: authors }).where(({ a }) => eq(a.id, p.authorId)).findOne(),\n  ),\n}))","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tcontext","text":"TContext","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"query","text":"query","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction materialize<TContext>(query): MaterializeWrapper<GetInlineResult<TContext>, TContext extends SingleResult ? true : false>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/builder/functions.ts:867](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/builder/functions.ts#L867)\n\nMaterialize an includes subquery into a plain value on the parent row.\n\n- For multi-row subqueries, the parent receives an `Array<T>` snapshot\n  (equivalent to `toArray()`).\n- For `findOne()` subqueries, the parent receives a single `T | undefined`\n  value — `undefined` when no child matches.\n\nThe snapshot updates reactively: parent rows re-emit when the underlying\nchildren change.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TContext\n\n`TContext` *extends* [`Context`](../interfaces/Context.md)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### query\n\n[`QueryBuilder`](../type-aliases/QueryBuilder.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`MaterializeWrapper`\\<`GetInlineResult`\\<`TContext`\\>, `TContext` *extends* [`SingleResult`](../type-aliases/SingleResult.md) ? `true` : `false`\\>\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n// Multi-row: produces Array<Issue> on each project\nselect(({ p }) => ({\n  ...p,\n  issues: materialize(\n    q.from({ i: issues }).where(({ i }) => eq(i.projectId, p.id)),\n  ),\n}))\n\n// Singleton: produces Author | undefined on each post\nselect(({ p }) => ({\n  ...p,\n  author: materialize(\n    q.from({ a: authors }).where(({ a }) => eq(a.id, p.authorId)).findOne(),\n  ),\n}))\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: materialize\ntitle: materialize\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction materialize<TContext>(query): MaterializeWrapper<GetInlineResult<TContext>, TContext extends SingleResult ? true : false>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/builder/functions.ts:867](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/builder/functions.ts#L867)\n\nMaterialize an includes subquery into a plain value on the parent row.\n\n- For multi-row subqueries, the parent receives an `Array<T>` snapshot\n  (equivalent to `toArray()`).\n- For `findOne()` subqueries, the parent receives a single `T | undefined`\n  value — `undefined` when no child matches.\n\nThe snapshot updates reactively: parent rows re-emit when the underlying\nchildren change.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TContext\n\n`TContext` *extends* [`Context`](../interfaces/Context.md)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### query\n\n[`QueryBuilder`](../type-aliases/QueryBuilder.md)\\<`TContext`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`MaterializeWrapper`\\<`GetInlineResult`\\<`TContext`\\>, `TContext` *extends* [`SingleResult`](../type-aliases/SingleResult.md) ? `true` : `false`\\>\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n// Multi-row: produces Array<Issue> on each project\nselect(({ p }) => ({\n  ...p,\n  issues: materialize(\n    q.from({ i: issues }).where(({ i }) => eq(i.projectId, p.id)),\n  ),\n}))\n\n// Singleton: produces Author | undefined on each post\nselect(({ p }) => ({\n  ...p,\n  author: materialize(\n    q.from({ a: authors }).where(({ a }) => eq(a.id, p.authorId)).findOne(),\n  ),\n}))\n```\n"}
